==Strategy==
[[Psychocat (Rare Cat)|Neo Psychocat]] or [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Castaway Cat]] is very effective on this stage, with their good stackability and slow/freeze rate. [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Rover Cat Mk II]] is as good a meatshield as always, but you may need to use [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Wall Cat]] or normal [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cat]] for added support. Any general DPS unit can be used to counter both the boss and the peons ([[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Dancing Flasher Cat]], [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]], [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]], [[Wheel Cat (Rare Cat)|Chill Cat]], [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg Cat]], [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Sexy Legs Cat]], etc.).

